[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/1874430250","html_url":"https://github.com/libgeos/geos/issues/1022#issuecomment-1874430250","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1022","id":1874430250,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACh1KM5vuYkq","user":{"login":"dr-jts","id":3529053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjkwNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3529053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts","html_url":"https://github.com/dr-jts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-02T19:06:33Z","updated_at":"2024-01-02T19:06:33Z","body":"The IM matrix computed by `relate` is very wrong as well (e.g. it says that `dim(Int n Int) = 2`):\r\n```\r\nbin/geosop -a \"GEOMETRYCOLLECTION (POINT (7 1), LINESTRING (6 5, 6 4))\" -b \"POLYGON ((7 1, 1 3,  3 9,  7 1))\" relate \r\n212FF0212\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/1874430250/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/1875628964","html_url":"https://github.com/libgeos/geos/issues/1022#issuecomment-1875628964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1022","id":1875628964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACh1KM5vy9Ok","user":{"login":"JamesParrott","id":80779630,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNzc5NjMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80779630?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott","html_url":"https://github.com/JamesParrott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesParrott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-03T16:20:29Z","updated_at":"2024-01-03T16:20:29Z","body":"I can recreate this, but it's very sensitive to the floating-point value of the first point (7, 1), and the bug does not occur when the line string is replaced by a point.\r\n\r\n```\r\nroot@523c8b976142:/tmp/geos/build# geosop -a \"GEOMETRYCOLLECTION (POINT (6.9999999999999999 1), LINESTRING (6 5, 6 4))\" -b\r\n \"POLYGON ((7 1, 1 3,  3 9,  7 1))\" crosses\r\ntrue\r\nroot@523c8b976142:/tmp/geos/build# geosop -a \"GEOMETRYCOLLECTION (POINT (6.999999999999999 1), LINESTRING (6 5, 6 4))\" -b\r\n\"POLYGON ((7 1, 1 3,  3 9,  7 1))\" crosses\r\nfalse\r\nroot@523c8b976142:/tmp/geos/build# geosop -a \"GEOMETRYCOLLECTION (POINT (7 1), POINT (60 5))\" -b \"POLYGON ((7 1, 1 3,  3 9\r\n,  7 1))\" crosses\r\nfalse\r\n```\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/1875628964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/1875673344","html_url":"https://github.com/libgeos/geos/issues/1022#issuecomment-1875673344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1022","id":1875673344,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACh1KM5vzIEA","user":{"login":"dr-jts","id":3529053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjkwNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3529053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts","html_url":"https://github.com/dr-jts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-03T16:52:32Z","updated_at":"2024-01-03T16:53:17Z","body":"This isn't a precision problem.  It's an issue with the current `relate` algorithm not handling mixed-dimension GeometryCollections correctly.  Likely it involves an incorrect evaluation of endpoints as boundary points.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/1875673344/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/1888811069","html_url":"https://github.com/libgeos/geos/issues/1022#issuecomment-1888811069","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1022","id":1888811069,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACh1KM5wlPg9","user":{"login":"cuteDen-ECNU","id":93959004,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZmzXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU","html_url":"https://github.com/cuteDen-ECNU","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-12T10:13:48Z","updated_at":"2024-01-12T10:19:29Z","body":"Another trigger case seems to have the same root cause:\r\n```shell\r\nbin/geosop -a 'GEOMETRYCOLLECTION (POINT (2 2), LINESTRING (0 0, 1 1))' -b 'LINESTRING ( 2 2, 3 3)' relate\r\n# 1F10F0102\r\n```\r\nIt says that `dim(Int n Int) = 1`, which is the same as dim(b).\r\nMeanwhile, `POINT(2 2)` is the start-point of b.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/1888811069/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]